## Frequently Asked Questions

{% faq
   title="Admin FAQ"
   items=[
     {"question": "How do I add more admin users?", "answer": "Set the user's role to 'admin' in the database. You can do this via Drizzle Studio, a direct SQL query, or by creating a seed script. Admins can then access /admin and perform management actions."},
     {"question": "Can I create different admin permission levels?", "answer": "By default, all admins have full access. For granular admin permissions, extend the ADMIN_ROLES array in admin-config.ts and add permission checks to specific admin actions. Some teams use 'super_admin' and 'support' roles."},
     {"question": "Is impersonation logged for audit purposes?", "answer": "Yes. Better Auth logs impersonation sessions with the original admin user ID. You can query the sessions table to see who impersonated whom and when. Always review impersonation logs as part of your security audit."},
     {"question": "How do I add analytics charts to the admin dashboard?", "answer": "Create a new admin page under apps/web/app/[locale]/admin/analytics/. Query your database for the metrics you need, then render them with a charting library like Recharts or Chart.js. Follow the existing metric card patterns."},
     {"question": "What's the safest way to delete user data for GDPR requests?", "answer": "Use the removeUser action which cascades deletions properly. For partial deletion (anonymization), update user fields to placeholder values while keeping the account structure. Always backup before bulk deletions."}
   ]
/%}

